      "writtenOn": "2022-06-23T22:13:24Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I think we need to provide explicit guidance to the ODMs for how to use the `extra-flags` property.  `FORCE_IDLE` is not very descriptive or helpful without the ODM digging into the charger task implementation.\n\nEven as I look at the code, I find it hard to understand how this extra_flag actually controls the LED behavior.  \n\nIs this interpretation correct?\nLED_CHFLAG_FORCE_IDLE: The LED policy is only applied when battery charging is disabled.\nLED_CHFLAG_DEFAULT: The LED policy is only applied when battery charging is allowed.\nNone: extra_flags is ignored and the LED policy is always applied.",
